          "Text": "Worley Noise scatters points and asks, everywhere, which is nearest. Its Cells mode gives each cell a number, which the Cosine Gradient colors; a second Worley in Borders mode draws the lines between them, multiplied on top. Turn Frequency and Randomness on both, and the Distance Metric."
